OL,3,A'Angel by my side' - Miley Cyrus pays
OL,4,Atribute to godmother Dolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,FParton is known for iconic songs
OL,7,Fincluding Jolene, 9 to 5 and I Will
OL,8,FAlways Love You. She was also a
OL,9,Fphilanthropist, who helped fund one of
OL,10,Fthe first Covid-19 vaccines and poured
OL,11,Fmillions into improving children's
OL,12,Fliteracy.
